    p.Article-Paragraph.
      Note that unlike the previous example has been contained inside the #[+Term--YDID path]
        (for example, #[+SecondaryEntity__Code--YDID https://example.com/products/1]) here the post identifier
        is being passed via #[+Term--YDID query parameters].
      The implementation with posts identifiers passed via #[+Term--YDID path] will be more difficult especially it it
        must work for the other routes too.


    //- ━━━ Routing in YDB ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    +Heading--YDF({
      level: 2,
