    p.Article-Paragraph.
      As far as #[+Term--YDID routes] number become larger, naturally there is as need to group them somehow.
      If you are striving to avoid the #[+Term--YDID classes] at any cost, you can extract you #[+Term--YDID routes]
        to files and import them to the #[+Term--YDID entry point].
      In our example, we have two #[+Term--YDID routes] of four are related with products which are the first candidate
        to extract them.

